// Pillar 5 Step 3, M8 team jobs: the fallback when Calder leads (neither Torres nor Halloran on shift). Short and
// exact. Seat M2 plays it. Head writer W2.
title: Team job
from: Chief Ines Calder
gist: Calder showed you team jobs: your spot, her call, your part.
== lines
calder: Four people. One job. One voice: mine.   [gesture]
calder > you: That's your spot. You brace, you pass, you brace. On my call.
calder: Nobody moves until I say. Then you move quickly.
calder: Questions? Good. Begin.
